[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-3) pid=21766, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m Please answer the following question: Read the following article and select the best answer. Article: In English, we often use some expressions with "cat". Such as a fat cat, it is a rich and important person. Sometimes people call a mean person a "mean old cat". Sometimes we cat around. That means we spend time together in a relaxed way. Sometimes we cat fight. That means we have small,violent quarrel. And sometimes we catnap. That means we sleep for a very short time during the day. People may tell you to keep your cat in. That means you should keep a promise. People may tell you that you have got someone's tongue. You have been telling secrets you should keep. And if you are scared, you may tell someone that you are afraid of your own shadow  , that means you are scared of things that don't really exist  . A person who likes to take a trip on a high wire   without a safety net is called a high wire act. And a person who takes a dangerous trip in a small place is a yo-yo act. A catwalk is the way fashion models   walk as they show衣服 on a stage. If all the cats are away, that means the people in charge are not there, and the people working under them have more freedom to do things their way. Question: We can guess   _   probably isn't a rich and important person Options: A: a fat cat B: a mean old cat C: a thin cat D: a smart cat
