[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-2) pid=603745)[0m 
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-2) pid=603745)[0m This is an arithmetic sequence where the first term \(a = 0\) and the common difference \(d = 6\). The general term of this sequence is given by:
