[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-2) pid=603745)[0m \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-2) pid=603745)[0m 
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-2) pid=603745)[0m We need to find the largest \(n\) such that \(a_n \leq 100\):
