[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-2) pid=603745)[0m \int_{3}^{6} \int_{-\sqrt{36 - z^2}}^{\sqrt{36 - z^2}} \int_{-\sqrt{36 - z^2 - y^2}}^{\sqrt{36 - z^2 - y^2}} z(x^2 + y^2 + z^2)^{-\frac{3}{2}} \, dx \, dy \, dz
