[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-2) pid=603745)[0m 
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-2) pid=603745)[0m Therefore, the correct bounds for \( x, y, \) and \( z \) in the integral are:
