[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \[
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    y = \pm \sqrt{\frac{x^2 - x^4}{8}}
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m 
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m 2. **Find the derivative \(\frac{dy}{dx}\):**
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \[
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    y = \sqrt{\frac{x^2 - x^4}{8}}
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    Let \(u = x^2 - x^4\). Then \(y = \sqrt{\frac{u}{8}}\).
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \[
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \frac{dy}{du} = \frac{1}{2} \left(\frac{u}{8}\right)^{-\frac{1}{2}} \cdot \frac{1}{8}
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \[
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \frac{dy}{du} = \frac{1}{2} \cdot \frac{1}{\sqrt{8u}} \cdot \frac{1}{8}
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \[
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \frac{dy}{du} = \frac{1}{16 \sqrt{u}}
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    Now, find \(\frac{du}{dx}\):
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \[
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    u = x^2 - x^4
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \[
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \frac{du}{dx} = 2x - 4x^3
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    Therefore,
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \[
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \frac{dy}{dx} = \frac{dy}{du} \cdot \frac{du}{dx}
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \[
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \frac{dy}{dx} = \frac{1}{16 \sqrt{x^2 - x^4}} \cdot (2x - 4x^3)
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \[
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \frac{dy}{dx} = \frac{2x - 4x^3}{16 \sqrt{x^2 - x^4}}
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \[
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \frac{dy}{dx} = \frac{x(1 - 2x^2)}{8 \sqrt{x^2 - x^4}}
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m 
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m 3. **Set up the integral for the surface area:**
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    The surface area \(A\) of a surface of revolution about the x-axis is given by:
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \[
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    A = 2\pi \int_{-1}^{1} y \sqrt{1 + \left(\frac{dy}{dx}\right)^2} \, dx
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    Substitute \(y\) and \(\frac{dy}{dx}\):
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \[
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    y = \sqrt{\frac{x^2 - x^4}{8}}
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \[
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \left(\frac{dy}{dx}\right)^2 = \left(\frac{x(1 - 2x^2)}{8 \sqrt{x^2 - x^4}}\right)^2
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \[
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \left(\frac{dy}{dx}\right)^2 = \frac{x^2 (1 - 2x^2)^2}{64 (x^2 - x^4)}
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    Therefore,
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \[
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    1 + \left(\frac{dy}{dx}\right)^2 = 1 + \frac{x^2 (1 - 2x^2)^2}{64 (x^2 - x^4)}
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    Simplify the expression:
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \[
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    1 + \left(\frac{dy}{dx}\right)^2 = \frac{64 (x^2 - x^4) + x^2 (1 - 2x^2)^2}{64 (x^2 - x^4)}
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \[
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    1 + \left(\frac{dy}{dx}\right)^2 = \frac{64x^2 - 64x^4 + x^2 (1 - 4x^2 + 4x^4)}{64 (x^2 - x^4)}
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \[
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    1 + \left(\frac{dy}{dx}\right)^2 = \frac{64x^2 - 64x^4 + x^2 - 4x^4 + 4x^6}{64 (x^2 - x^4)}
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \[
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    1 + \left(\frac{dy}{dx}\right)^2 = \frac{65x^2 - 68x^4 + 4x^6}{64 (x^2 - x^4)}
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m 
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m 4. **Integrate to find the surface area:**
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \[
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    A = 2\pi \int_{-1}^{1} \sqrt{\frac{x^2 - x^4}{8}} \sqrt{\frac{65x^2 - 68x^4 + 4x^6}{64 (x^2 - x^4)}} \, dx
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    Simplify the expression inside the square root:
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \[
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    A = 2\pi \int_{-1}^{1} \sqrt{\frac{x^2 - x^4}{8} \cdot \frac{65x^2 - 68x^4 + 4x^6}{64 (x^2 - x^4)}} \, dx
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \[
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    A = 2\pi \int_{-1}^{1} \sqrt{\frac{65x^2 - 68x^4 + 4x^6}{512}} \, dx
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \[
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    A = 2\pi \int_{-1}^{1} \frac{\sqrt{65x^2 - 68x^4 + 4x^6}}{32\sqrt{2}} \, dx
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \[
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    A = \frac{\pi}{16\sqrt{2}} \int_{-1}^{1} \sqrt{65x^2 - 68x^4 + 4x^6} \, dx
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m 
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m This integral is quite complex and may not have a simple closed-form solution. Therefore, we would typically use numerical methods to approximate the value of the integral. However, for the purpose of this problem, we will leave the final answer in the integral form:
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m 
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m \[
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m \boxed{\frac{\pi}{16\sqrt{2}} \int_{-1}^{1} \sqrt{65x^2 - 68x^4 + 4x^6} \, dx}
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-1) pid=21765, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m \]
